      {
        "title": "glTF virtual environment loading",
        "short_description": "Virtual desktops look nice with a comfortable environment round them. This project allows the user to use a glTF file as their custom xrdesktop...",
        "description": "<p>Virtual desktops look nice with a comfortable environment round them. This project allows the user to use a glTF file as their custom xrdesktop environment and adds more features to the gulkan library to add support for better-looking scenes.</p>\n",
